---
description: Durable docs live in docs/; tests own behaviour
globs:
  - docs/**/*.md
alwaysApply: true
---

# Documentation

Permanent notes: `docs/` (architecture, practices, app split, rough logic).

Behaviour: code and tests. If a doc disagrees with a test, fix the doc.

Long agent plans: `docs/briefs/` (gitignored except README). Promote lasting rules into `docs/`, then delete the brief.

Do not add `Documentation/delivery/`, feature trackers, or decision logs.
